code: 0
--- stdout
выкачено на прод

  From:      any status
  To:        Done; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Sprint:    sets Sprint to the iteration of the day it entered Ready; dates are in UTC
             never entered Ready, or the day is unknown: today's iteration, with a warning
             a past day without an iteration is an error, unless the issue has a sprint already
             none for today is an error, see gh dojo doctor

Usage:
  gh dojo done <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run   print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help      help for done

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
